<view class="page bottom-space"
  ><view class="eyebrow">MILEAGE / 月度里程</view
  ><view class="title">记录走过的路。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取里程信息…</view
  ><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="empty"
    ><view>{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="reload">重新加载</button
    ><button class="text-button" bindtap="openUse">返回用车</button></view
  ><view wx:elif="{{submitted}}" class="card"
    ><view class="tag">待审核</view><view class="section-title">里程复核记录已保存</view
    ><view class="muted">本次录入不代表后台已审核，也不会自动生成费用。</view
    ><button class="primary" bindtap="openRecord">查看记录</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="returnToPeriods">查看月台账与其他月份</button></view
  ><view wx:elif="{{!subscription}}" class="empty"
    ><view class="section-title">暂无可复核里程的订阅</view
    ><button class="secondary" bindtap="openUse">返回用车</button></view
  ><block wx:else
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="label">本订阅逐车月台账</view
      ><view wx:if="{{usage.assignmentTracked && !usage.currentAssignment}}" class="notice">当前暂无分配车辆，换车待交付；仍可核对历史段及月界证据，不把旧车当作当前用车。</view><view class="price">每订阅月 {{usage.baseAllowanceKm}} 公里</view><view class="muted">从实际交车日起按订阅月计算，基础优先使用、期末清零；里程包余额 {{usage.packBalanceKm}} 公里 · {{usage.packStatusText}}</view></view
    ><view class="card"><view class="section-title">选择需要申报或补证的订阅月</view><view wx:if="{{!usage.periods.length}}" class="muted">尚无可读取月份，请联系运营核对实际交车日期。</view><radio-group bindchange="selectUsagePeriod"><label wx:for="{{usage.periods}}" wx:key="id" class="attachment-row"><radio value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{periodId === item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !item.canSubmit}}" color="#B44919"/><view><view>第 {{item.sequence}} 月 · {{item.periodText}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.statusText}} · 月界/归还日 {{item.boundaryDateText}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.reviewNote}}" class="notice">{{item.reviewNote}}</view></view></label></radio-group></view
    ><view class="notice"
      >仅申报所选订阅月和车辆分配段月界或归还日的实际仪表照片与累计读数。缺报、照片不足须补证，尚未人工审核时不会估算或跨月平均分摊，也不表示费用已结算。</view
    ><block wx:if="{{selectedPeriod}}"><view wx:if="{{selectedPeriod.segmented}}" class="card"><view class="section-title">选择本月需要申报的车辆段</view><view class="notice">每辆车分别使用本车仪表基线和照片；不同车辆不能相减。本月全部段核验后仅合计一次基础与包额度，缺证据仍待补。</view><view wx:if="{{!selectedPeriod.segments.length}}" class="muted">分配证据待运营核对，不能按旧车仪表申报。</view><radio-group bindchange="selectUsageSegment"><label wx:for="{{selectedPeriod.segments}}" wx:key="id" class="attachment-row"><radio value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{segmentId === item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !item.canSubmit}}" color="#B44919"/><view><view>{{item.vehicleTitle}} · {{item.statusText}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.startAtText}} — {{item.endAtText}}</view><view>本车仪表 {{item.startReadingKm == null ? '待证据' : item.startReadingKm}} → {{item.endReadingKm == null ? '待证据' : item.endReadingKm}} km</view></view></label></radio-group></view><block wx:if="{{!selectedPeriod.segmented || selectedSegment}}"><view class="card"><view class="section-title">第 {{selectedPeriod.sequence}} 月 · {{selectedPeriod.periodText}}</view><view wx:if="{{selectedSegment}}" class="section-title">{{selectedSegment.vehicleTitle}}</view><view class="muted">本车期初确认读数 {{selectedPeriod.segmented ? (selectedSegment.startReadingKm == null ? "待证据" : selectedSegment.startReadingKm + " km") : (selectedPeriod.startReadingKm == null ? "待前月结算核对" : selectedPeriod.startReadingKm + " km")}}；请使用 {{boundaryDate}} 实际拍摄的仪表照片。</view><view class="field"><view class="label">照片实际拍摄日期（北京时间）</view><picker mode="date" start="{{boundaryDate}}" end="{{boundaryDate}}" value="{{recordedDate}}" bindchange="captureDate" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input">{{recordedDate || '请选择实际拍摄日期'}}</view></picker></view><view class="field"><view class="label">照片实际拍摄时间（北京时间）</view><picker mode="time" value="{{recordedTime}}" bindchange="captureTime" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="input">{{recordedTime || '请选择实际拍摄时分'}}</view></picker></view></view><view class="card"
      ><view class="field"
        ><view class="label">累计里程（km）</view
        ><input
          class="input reading-input"
          type="number"
          value="{{reading}}"
          maxlength="7"
          placeholder="输入当前读数"
          data-field="reading"
          bindinput="input"
          disabled="{{busy}}" /></view
      ></view
    ><view class="card"
      ><view class="section-title">仪表盘凭证</view
      ><view class="muted"
        >至少上传 1 张。最多 4 张，每张不超过 10 MB。</view
      ><view wx:for="{{attachments}}" wx:key="index" class="attachment-row"
        ><text>{{item.name}} · 已上传</text
        ><button
          class="text-button"
          data-index="{{index}}"
          bindtap="removeAttachment"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
          >移除</button
        ></view
      ><button
        wx:if="{{attachments.length < 4}}"
        class="secondary"
        bindtap="chooseAttachments"
        loading="{{choosing}}"
        disabled="{{busy || choosing}}"
        >上传仪表凭证</button
      ></view
    ><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || choosing || !reading || !recordedDate || !recordedTime || !attachments.length}}"
      >提交本订阅月仪表证据</button
    ></block></block><button class="secondary" bindtap="openUsage">查看月结算、里程包及退订结算</button></block
  ></view
>
